      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The geode is attached to a creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The geode deals 1d4 Bludgeoning Damage damage to the creature it's attached to (Basic DC 15 Fortitude Saving Throw save).</p>",
